<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ApexRoster | Performance Influencer Marketing Agency</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: #090d16; color: #f8fafc; line-height: 1.6; scroll-behavior: smooth; }
        
        /* Navigation */
        header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 18px 8%; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
        .logo { font-size: 1.55rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: #ffffff; }
        .logo span { color: #38bdf8; }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 25px; align-items: center; }
        .nav-links a.text-link { color: #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 500; transition: 0.2s; }
        .nav-links a.text-link:hover { color: #38bdf8; }
        .nav-btn { background: #38bdf8; color: #090d16; padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem; transition: 0.3s; }
        .nav-btn:hover { background: #7dd3fc; transform: translateY(-1px); }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero { text-align: center; padding: 100px 8% 80px; max-width: 950px; margin: auto; }
        .badge { display: inline-block; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12); color: #38bdf8; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
        .hero h1 { font-size: 3.1rem; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 22px; font-weight: 800; }
        .hero h1 span { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #38bdf8, #818cf8); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }
        .hero p { font-size: 1.15rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 38px; max-width: 720px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
        .cta-group { display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .btn-primary { background: #38bdf8; color: #090d16; padding: 15px 30px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; transition: 0.3s; }
        .btn-primary:hover { background: #7dd3fc; }
        .btn-secondary { background: #1e293b; border: 1px solid #334155; color: #f8fafc; padding: 15px 30px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; transition: 0.3s; }
        .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: #38bdf8; color: #38bdf8; }

        /* Stats Bar */
        .stats-bar { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; max-width: 1050px; margin: 0 auto 40px; padding: 28px; background: #111827; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #1f2937; text-align: center; }
        .stat-item h4 { font-size: 1.8rem; color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 800; }
        .stat-item p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 4px; }

        /* Sections & Cards */
        .section { padding: 75px 8%; max-width: 1120px; margin: auto; }
        .section-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px; }
        .section-header h2 { font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .section-header p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 1.05rem; }
        .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(290px, 1fr)); gap: 26px; }
        .card { background: #111827; padding: 32px; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid #1f2937; transition: 0.3s; }
        .card:hover { border-color: #38bdf8; transform: translateY(-4px); }
        .card h3 { color: #f8fafc; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 1.25rem; }
        .card p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem; }
        .step-num { display: inline-block; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 800; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 14px; font-size: 0.85rem; }

        /* Roster Cards */
        .roster-tag { display: inline-block; background: #1e293b; color: #38bdf8; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .metric-list { list-style: none; margin-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #1f2937; padding-top: 15px; }
        .metric-list li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #cbd5e1; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .metric-list span { color: #94a3b8; }

        /* Interactive Inquiry Box */
        .contact-box { background: linear-gradient(145deg, #111827, #0f172a); padding: 50px 35px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #38bdf8; max-width: 780px; margin: auto; text-align: center; }
        .tab-buttons { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; margin: 25px 0; }
        .tab-btn { padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #334155; background: #1e293b; color: #cbd5e1; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s; }
        .tab-btn.active { background: #38bdf8; color: #090d16; border-color: #38bdf8; }
        .tab-content { display: none; text-align: left; background: #090d16; padding: 28px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #1e293b; }
        .tab-content.active { display: block; }
        .tab-content h4 { color: #38bdf8; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.15rem; }
        .tab-content p { color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 18px; }
        .action-pill { display: inline-block; background: #38bdf8; color: #090d16; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem; word-break: break-all; }

        footer { text-align: center; padding: 35px 8%; color: #64748b; font-size: 0.9rem; border-top: 1px solid #1e293b; margin-top: 60px; }
        @media (max-width: 768px) { 
            .hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; } 
            .nav-links a.text-link { display: none; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">APEX<span>ROSTER</span></div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#process" class="text-link">How It Works</a>
            <a href="#roster" class="text-link">Creator Network</a>
            <a href="#contact" class="nav-btn">Launch Campaign</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="badge">100% Digital Creator Matchmaking</div>
        <h1>Scale Your Brand With <span>Vetted Micro-Creators</span></h1>
        <p>ApexRoster connects high-growth Indian D2C brands with authentic Instagram and YouTube creators. No bloated retainers—just fast, data-backed creator campaigns that convert.</p>
        <div class="cta-group">
            <a href="#contact" onclick="switchTab('brand')" class="btn-primary">Get Custom Creator List</a>
            <a href="#contact" onclick="switchTab('creator')" class="btn-secondary">Join ApexRoster Talent</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
        <div class="stats-bar">
            <div class="stat-item">
                <h4>24 Hrs</h4>
                <p>Creator Roster Delivery</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <h4>100%</h4>
                <p>Audience Authenticity Checked</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <h4>Zero</h4>
                <p>Monthly Lock-In Retainers</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="section" id="process">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>How ApexRoster Works</h2>
            <p>A streamlined, fully remote workflow built for speed and ROI.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-3">
            <div class="card">
                <span class="step-num">STEP 01</span>
                <h3>Share Campaign Brief</h3>
                <p>Send us your product link, target demographic, and budget. We align on the exact content style your brand needs.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <span class="step-num">STEP 02</span>
                <h3>Approve Your Roster</h3>
                <p>Within 24 hours, receive a curated list of vetted creators with verified engagement rates, average views, and transparent pricing.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <span class="step-num">STEP 03</span>
                <h3>Content Goes Live</h3>
                <p>We handle creator coordination, product dispatch tracking, script guidelines, and on-time Reel/Short publishing.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="roster">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>Sample Roster Categories</h2>
            <p>Pre-vetted creators ready for product seeding and paid integrations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-3">
            <div class="card">
                <span class="roster-tag">Fitness & Nutrition</span>
                <h3>Tier-1 Fitness Roster</h3>
                <p>Gym enthusiasts, supplement reviewers, and transformation creators with high buyer trust.</p>
                <ul class="metric-list">
                    <li><span>Follower Tier:</span> <strong>10K – 65K</strong></li>
                    <li><span>Avg. Reel Views:</span> <strong>18,000+</strong></li>
                    <li><span>Engagement Rate:</span> <strong>4.8% Avg</strong></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <span class="roster-tag">Skincare & Grooming</span>
                <h3>D2C Beauty & Care</h3>
                <p>Routine-focused creators driving high click-through rates for men's and women's personal care.</p>
                <ul class="metric-list">
                    <li><span>Follower Tier:</span> <strong>15K – 80K</strong></li>
